  "details": "Description\n\nEvery time I join a world there's seemingly a 50% chance of the game completely freezing, and often when I'm in a world it locks up an plays the same audio buffer over and over. Setting the safety mode to maximum does nothing to prevent the crashes, nor does clearing the cache.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nJoining Test Pilots public or group public worlds, switching safety modes, sometimes simply existing, switching to a JP keyboard\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Other\n\n- Frequency: Often\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.3p2-1921-15c4a824b2-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-10-15_20-31-09.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_809fba3c-ddff-42ec-b70d-f4999f79d9e6/1/file)",
